windows-font-family-names

quiet.md: on Windows a font set matches a family by its name in the system's language only, so a family saved by its English name (Microsoft YaHei, SimSun) finds nothing on a Chinese system. When a name finds nothing, try the family's names in its other languages (IDWriteFontCollection::FindFamilyName, else every family's names). Also for font fallbacks.

